  "_register_note": "register pins an outlet that only ever files one kind of piece. It overrides the scorer's per-article guess in phScorer (applyRegisterPin), because register selects the marker exemption AND changes the composite: a non-news register halves the language weight and switches off the loaded-headline and emotional-lede floors. Leave it absent for any outlet that mixes registers, such as NPR or BBC News, so the scorer still decides per article."
}
